</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-36656 size-large" src="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-prime-burger-1024x640.png" alt="schweid and sons the prime burger made from premium cuts of usda prime chuck" width="1024" height="640" srcset="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-prime-burger-1024x640.png 1024w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-prime-burger-300x188.png 300w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-prime-burger-768x480.png 768w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-prime-burger-150x94.png 150w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-prime-burger-600x375.png 600w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-prime-burger-1536x960.png 1536w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-prime-burger-2048x1280.png 2048w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-prime-burger-640x400.png 640w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-prime-burger-87x55.png 87w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-prime-burger-400x250.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://schweidandsons.com/product/the-all-natural-blend/"><strong>The All Natural Blend</strong></a><strong> – Chuck, Round, Sirloin (75/25).</strong> Clean and lean with a flavorful beefy edge. This Certified Humane blend offers a slightly firmer texture and a wholesome bite, perfect for those who value simplicity, balance, and ethically raised meat.</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-36562 size-large" src="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-all-natural-blend-1024x683.png" alt="schweid and sons the all natural blend made with 100% all natural angus beef" width="1024" height="683" srcset="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-all-natural-blend-1024x683.png 1024w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-all-natural-blend-300x200.png 300w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-all-natural-blend-768x512.png 768w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-all-natural-blend-150x100.png 150w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-all-natural-blend-600x400.png 600w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-all-natural-blend-1536x1024.png 1536w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-all-natural-blend-2048x1365.png 2048w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-all-natural-blend-640x427.png 640w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-all-natural-blend-400x267.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://schweidandsons.com/product/the-butchers-blend/"><strong>The Butcher’s Blend</strong></a><strong> – Chuck, Round, Sirloin (80/20).</strong> Beefy and structured with a bit less fat. This leaner blend keeps its shape on the grill and delivers a meat-forward flavor with a satisfying chew. Also available in <a href="https://schweidandsons.com/product/c-a-b-the-butchers-blend/">Certified Angus Beef®</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-36651 size-large" src="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-butchers-blend-1024x683.png" alt="schweid and sons the butcher's blend burgers made from premium cuts of beef" width="1024" height="683" srcset="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-butchers-blend-1024x683.png 1024w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-butchers-blend-300x200.png 300w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-butchers-blend-768x512.png 768w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-butchers-blend-150x100.png 150w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-butchers-blend-600x400.png 600w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-butchers-blend-1536x1024.png 1536w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-butchers-blend-2048x1365.png 2048w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-butchers-blend-640x427.png 640w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-butchers-blend-400x267.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p>
