</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-36652 size-large" src="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-grass-fed-blend-1024x683.png" alt="schweid and sons the grass-fed blend made from premium cuts of grass-fed beef" width="1024" height="683" srcset="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-grass-fed-blend-1024x683.png 1024w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-grass-fed-blend-300x200.png 300w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-grass-fed-blend-768x512.png 768w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-grass-fed-blend-150x100.png 150w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-grass-fed-blend-600x400.png 600w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-grass-fed-blend-1536x1024.png 1536w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-grass-fed-blend-2048x1365.png 2048w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-grass-fed-blend-640x427.png 640w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-grass-fed-blend-400x267.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p>
