</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-36654 size-large" src="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-katana-blend-1024x640.png" alt="schweid and sons the katana blend made from premium cuts of american wagyu beef" width="1024" height="640" srcset="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-katana-blend-1024x640.png 1024w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-katana-blend-300x188.png 300w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-katana-blend-768x480.png 768w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-katana-blend-150x94.png 150w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-katana-blend-600x375.png 600w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-katana-blend-1536x960.png 1536w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-katana-blend-2048x1280.png 2048w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-katana-blend-640x400.png 640w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-katana-blend-87x55.png 87w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/schweid-and-sons-the-katana-blend-400x250.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p>
