<li><a href="https://schweidandsons.com/product/the-signature-blend/"><strong>The Signature Blend</strong></a><strong> – Chuck, Brisket (75/25).</strong> Smoky, juicy, and deeply flavorful. Brisket adds richness and a hearty grind to Chuck’s classic flavor, creating a blend that’s a crowd favorite.&nbsp;Also available in <a href="https://schweidandsons.com/product/c-a-b-custom-blend/">100% Certified Angus Beef®</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-36561 size-large" src="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-signature-blend-1024x683.png" alt="schweid and sons the signature blend made from premium blends of chuck and brisket" width="1024" height="683" srcset="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-signature-blend-1024x683.png 1024w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-signature-blend-300x200.png 300w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-signature-blend-768x512.png 768w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-signature-blend-150x100.png 150w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-signature-blend-600x400.png 600w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-signature-blend-1536x1024.png 1536w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-signature-blend-2048x1365.png 2048w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-signature-blend-640x427.png 640w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Schweid-Sons-the-signature-blend-400x267.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://schweidandsons.com/product/the-signature-blend-sliders/"><strong>The Signature Blend Sliders</strong></a><strong> – Chuck, Brisket (75/25).</strong> The same rich flavor as our Signature Blend, sized for Sliders. Perfect for Smashburgers, parties, samplers, or smaller portions. Also available in <a href="https://schweidandsons.com/product/certified-angus-beef-brand-the-signature-blend-sliders/">100% Certified Angus Beef®</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-36355 size-large" src="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Schweid-and-sons-the-signature-blend-sliders-PNG-1024x683.png" alt="schweid and sons the signature blend 2.5oz sliders made from premium cuts of chuck and brisket" width="1024" height="683" srcset="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Schweid-and-sons-the-signature-blend-sliders-PNG-1024x683.png 1024w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Schweid-and-sons-the-signature-blend-sliders-PNG-300x200.png 300w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Schweid-and-sons-the-signature-blend-sliders-PNG-768x512.png 768w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Schweid-and-sons-the-signature-blend-sliders-PNG-150x100.png 150w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Schweid-and-sons-the-signature-blend-sliders-PNG-600x400.png 600w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Schweid-and-sons-the-signature-blend-sliders-PNG-1536x1024.png 1536w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Schweid-and-sons-the-signature-blend-sliders-PNG-2048x1365.png 2048w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Schweid-and-sons-the-signature-blend-sliders-PNG-640x427.png 640w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Schweid-and-sons-the-signature-blend-sliders-PNG-400x267.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://schweidandsons.com/product/the-heritage-blend-burger/"><strong>The Heritage Blend</strong></a><strong> – Chuck, Brisket, Sirloin (75/25).</strong> Balanced and beefy with layered flavor. Sirloin adds clean meatiness to the rich Chuck and Brisket base, giving you a blend that’s savory, structured, and satisfying.</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-36657 size-large" src="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/schweid-and-sons-heritage-blend-1024x640.png" alt="schweid and sons the heritage blend made from premium cuts of chuck brisket and sirloin" width="1024" height="640" srcset="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/schweid-and-sons-heritage-blend-1024x640.png 1024w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/schweid-and-sons-heritage-blend-300x188.png 300w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/schweid-and-sons-heritage-blend-768x480.png 768w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/schweid-and-sons-heritage-blend-150x94.png 150w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/schweid-and-sons-heritage-blend-600x375.png 600w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/schweid-and-sons-heritage-blend-1536x960.png 1536w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/schweid-and-sons-heritage-blend-2048x1280.png 2048w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/schweid-and-sons-heritage-blend-640x400.png 640w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/schweid-and-sons-heritage-blend-87x55.png 87w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/schweid-and-sons-heritage-blend-400x250.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://schweidandsons.com/product/the-smokehouse-blend/"><strong>The Smokehouse Blend</strong></a><strong> – Chuck, Brisket, Short Rib (75/25).</strong> Bold and decadent with serious depth. Short rib brings buttery texture and intense flavor, making this one of our richest, most luxurious blends. Also available in <a href="https://schweidandsons.com/product/c-a-b-the-smokehouse-blend/">100% Certified Angus Beef®</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-36658 size-large" src="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/schweid-and-sons-smokehouse-blend-1024x640.png" alt="schweid and sons the smokehouse blend made from premium cuts of chuck, brisket, and short rib" width="1024" height="640" srcset="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/schweid-and-sons-smokehouse-blend-1024x640.png 1024w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/schweid-and-sons-smokehouse-blend-300x188.png 300w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/schweid-and-sons-smokehouse-blend-768x480.png 768w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/schweid-and-sons-smokehouse-blend-150x94.png 150w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/schweid-and-sons-smokehouse-blend-600x375.png 600w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/schweid-and-sons-smokehouse-blend-1536x960.png 1536w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/schweid-and-sons-smokehouse-blend-2048x1280.png 2048w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/schweid-and-sons-smokehouse-blend-640x400.png 640w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/schweid-and-sons-smokehouse-blend-87x55.png 87w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/schweid-and-sons-smokehouse-blend-400x250.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://schweidandsons.com/product/the-ribeye-blend/"><strong>The Ribeye Blend</strong></a><strong> – Chuck, Ribeye (75/25).</strong> Steakhouse flavor in Burger form. Ribeye adds luxurious marbling and tender texture to Chuck’s hearty base, delivering a juicy, upscale Burger experience.</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-36642 size-large" src="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Schweid-Sons-the-ribeye-blend-1-1024x683.png" alt="schweid and sons the ribeye blend made from premium cuts of ribeye and chuck beef" width="1024" height="683" srcset="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Schweid-Sons-the-ribeye-blend-1-1024x683.png 1024w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Schweid-Sons-the-ribeye-blend-1-300x200.png 300w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Schweid-Sons-the-ribeye-blend-1-768x512.png 768w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Schweid-Sons-the-ribeye-blend-1-150x100.png 150w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Schweid-Sons-the-ribeye-blend-1-600x400.png 600w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Schweid-Sons-the-ribeye-blend-1-1536x1024.png 1536w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Schweid-Sons-the-ribeye-blend-1-2048x1365.png 2048w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Schweid-Sons-the-ribeye-blend-1-640x427.png 640w, https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Schweid-Sons-the-ribeye-blend-1-400x267.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p>
<h2>Can You Use the Whole Steer for Burgers?</h2>
<p>The short answer: not quite.</p>
<p>While most of the animal can be used for ground beef, not every part makes the cut—literally or figuratively. Certain parts are inedible or unsuitable for grinding, including the brain, eyes, skull, spinal cord, and certain organs. These are removed during processing and are never included in Burger blends, both for safety and quality reasons. At Schweid &amp; Sons, we’re especially selective.&nbsp;</p>
<h2>Why We Don’t Use Aged Steak Trim in Our Burger Blends</h2>
<p>Unlike some manufacturers, here at Schweid &amp; Sons we don’t toss in dry-aged steak trimmings or leftovers in our blends to use up excess product. Why? Because dry-aged steak trim behaves differently in the grinder—it tends to oxidize and dry out more quickly, which can negatively impact the flavor, freshness, and shelf life of your Burger. Instead, we use fresh, whole muscle cuts that maintain optimal moisture, structure, and taste.</p>
<p><em>Curious about our grinding process? Stay tuned—we’ve got a dedicated post coming later this month that’ll walk you through every step.</em></p>
<h2>Why the Cut Matters: The Schweid &amp; Sons Difference</h2>
<p>There’s a reason chefs, restaurants, and home cooks trust Schweid &amp; Sons. We believe that premium ground beef should be treated with the same care and precision as steaks—and that starts with choosing the right cuts. Our blends are made from carefully selected cuts, ground fresh and packed for maximum juiciness and consistency.</p>
<p>Every package of ground beef we create is the result of thoughtful sourcing, expert butchery, and a deep respect for the steer—only the best parts, in the best proportions, to make The Very Best Burgers, and beyond. Ready to taste the difference? Explore our <a href="https://schweidandsons.com/products/">full line of premium beef blends</a> and discover your new favorite!</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignleft wp-image-33749 size-medium" src="https://schweidandsons.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/option-2-e1719428463396-300x53.jpg" alt="beyond the blog graphic" width="300" height="53"></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>Find all Schweid &amp; Sons’ premium blends <a href="https://schweidandsons.com/products/?utm_source=Website&amp;utm_medium=Blog&amp;utm_campaign=BTB_Products">here</a>.</li>
<li>Shop your local grocers for Schweid &amp; Sons using our store locator link <a href="https://schweidandsons.com/locations/?utm_source=Website&amp;utm_medium=Blog&amp;utm_campaign=BTB_Locations">here</a>.</li>
<li>Let us know your favorite beef for a Burger, and your Schweid &amp; Sons Burger choice by tagging us on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/schweidandsons/">Instagram</a> using @schweidandsons or #schweidandsons.</li>
